  "description": "Community (free) edition of sgcNavigation .NET: sidebar, accordion and tree navigation bars with search, tabs and breadcrumbs for WinForms, WPF and Avalonia with the headless renderers. Free for both commercial and non-commercial use by small teams (individuals and organizations under EUR 1M annual gross revenue and no more than 5 developers); organizations at or above either threshold need a Commercial licence. Item Command binding, the command palette, tab reorder, pinned tabs, tab tear-off and persistence, and breadcrumb editing are not included in the Community edition. https://www.esegece.com",
